{"sourceUrl":"http://edu.ipe.ac.cn/zsxx/202507/t20250722_633490.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:56.644662+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://edu.ipe.ac.cn/zsxx/202507/t20250722_633490.html","html":"<td>\n<div><p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span><span><span>活动主旨</span></span><span><span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>为激发大学生从事科研的兴趣和热情，加深对科研工作的认识，从而吸引更多优秀学子到国科大求学深造，</span></span><span><span>中国科学院过程工程研究所已于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日至</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日成功举办</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年第一批</span><span>“化学与化工优秀大学生暑期学校”。根据我所夏令营</span></span><span>工作</span><span><span>计划，将于</span><span>8</span><span>月举办第二</span></span><span>期</span><span>活动，规模</span><span>约</span><span><span>100</span><span>人，活动</span></span><span>将</span><span>采取线</span><span>上线</span><span>下</span><span>相结合的</span><span>方式</span><span>开展</span><span>。诚邀广大优秀学子报名参加！</span></p><p><span>二、</span><strong><span>活动</span></strong><strong><span><span>安排</span></span></strong></p><div><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>内容</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>地点</span></strong></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span><span>即日起至</span><span>8月11日（23:59）</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>报名</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>——</span></strong></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>8月中旬</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>发布入营通知</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>——</span></strong></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>8月18日-20日</span></strong><strong><span><br/></span></strong><strong><span>（星期一至星期三）</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>线上活动</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>线上平台</span></strong></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>8月21日</span></strong><strong><span><br/></span></strong><strong><span>14:00-17:00</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>线下报到</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>过程工程所</span></strong></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>8月22日 全天</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>线下活动</span></strong></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span>过程工程所</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span><span>（如有调整请以我所通知时间为准。）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、报名步骤</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. <span>首先登录中国科学院大学科教结合协同育人行动计划平台，<strong>暑期学校</strong>在线申请系统（网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/cs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/cs</a><span>）</span><span>，</span><span>进入后选择</span><span>“过程工程研究所”</span><span>——</span><span>“中国科学院大学‘化学与化工’</span><span>优秀大学生夏令</span>营<span>”</span>进<span>行注册报名；完成国科大系统报名后，需打开下方链接，填写在线问卷并上传报名材料。</span></p><p><span>入营问卷链接：</span><a href=\"https://www.wjx.cn/vm/Yw2ut7Z.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.wjx.cn/vm/Yw2ut7Z.aspx</a><span>。</span></p><p><span>2. <span>提交入营申请电子版材料至研招办邮箱</span><span>yzb@ipe.ac.cn</span><span>，<strong>邮件主题</strong>和<strong>文件名称</strong>均为</span><span>“</span><span>学校全称</span><span>-</span><span>学院全称</span><span>-</span><span>专业全称</span><span>-</span><span>学生姓名</span><span>”</span><span>，所有材料必须按顺序整理到</span><strong><span>一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式文件</span></strong><span>中，文件大小不超过</span><span>20M</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>入营申请电子版材料列表：</span></span></p><p><span><span>①</span><span>中国科学院大学</span><span>2025</span><span>年大学生暑期夏令营申请表（报名系统生成）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>②</span><span>本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖教务处公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>③</span><span>英语水平证明复印件（如四</span><span>/</span><span>六级）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>④</span><span>其他证明材料（如推荐信、已发表论文首页的复印件、奖状复印件、各类证书复印件等）。此项为辅助材料，为非必交材料，自愿提交。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：网报期间不需要邮寄任何纸质材料。</span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、申请条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>专业要求：化工、材料、环境、化学、冶金、食品、生物工程、资源等化工相关专业，全日制普通高等学校本科</span>2022<span>级在校学生（大三，拟</span><span>2026</span><span>年毕业）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>满足专业要求同时达到以下任一条件即可申请：</span></span></p><p><span><span>①</span><span>专业排名满足条件：一流大学或原</span><span>985</span><span>高校专业前</span><span>30%</span><span>、化工一流学科建设高校或原</span><span>211</span><span>高校专业前</span><span>15%</span><span>、其他高校专业前</span><span>5%</span><span>且有推免资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>②</span><span>由两名过程工程研究所教育委员会或学位委员会成员推荐。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、所内生活</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. <span>学业奖学金：我所研究生在学期间全部享有学业奖学金，硕士学业奖学金为</span><span>8000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年，直博生学业奖学金为</span><span>13000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年。</span></span></p><p><span>2. <span>生活补助：我所研究生在学期间由课题组根据学习情况发放生活补助，正常情况下不低于</span><span>2733</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（硕士生一年级）、</span><span>3050</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（硕士生高年级）、</span><span>3150</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（直博生一年级）、</span><span>4380</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（普通博士和直博生高年级），每年夏季研究所会为学生发放</span><span>400</span><span>元高温补贴。</span></span></p><p><span>3. <span>国家助学金：我所研究生在正常学习年限内全部享有国家助学金，硕士为</span><span>500</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（即</span><span>6000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年），博士为</span><span>1250</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（即</span><span>15000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年）。</span></span></p><p><span>4. <span>竞争性奖学金：国家奖学金（</span><span>20000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>硕士，</span><span>30000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>博士）、中国科学院院长特别奖学金（</span><span>10000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、中国科学院院长优秀奖学金（</span><span>5000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、朱李月华博士奖学金（</span><span>5000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、过程所所长特别奖学金（</span><span>10000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、过程所所长优秀奖学金（</span><span>5000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、地奥奖学金（</span><span>1000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、中科环保奖（</span><span>1000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、张懿院士奖学金（</span><span>3000-6000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）等一系列竞争性奖学金。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>六、营员选拔</span></span></strong>  </p><p><span><span>营员筛选由教育处组织所内专家统筹选拔，并于</span>2025<span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span>中旬</span><span><span>公布入围名单。</span> </span></p><p><span><span>为便于师生提前互相了解，建议同学们主动联系感兴趣的导师。</span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>七、活动费用</span></span></strong> </p><p><span>1. <span>本次暑期学校不收取任何费用；</span> </span></p><p><span>2. <span>我所为每位营员提供</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日三</span></span><span><span>餐；</span> </span></p><p><span>3. <span>营员的</span></span><span>住宿及</span><span><span>交通费用自理。</span></span><span>（</span><span><span>注：获得过程工程研究所</span><span>“优营”资格并于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>10</span><span>月正式成为我所研究生的营员，可报销</span><span>2025</span><span>年第二期夏令营</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>-22</span><span>日的部分住宿及往返交通费用。住宿报销上限为</span><span>250</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>天（需发票），推荐酒店：北京西郊宾馆（北京市海淀区王庄路</span><span>18</span><span>号，标间为两人间，单日费用为协议价</span><span>500</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>间·天）；交通费报销限往返硬座、硬卧、高铁</span><span>/</span><span>动车二等座。</span></span><span>）</span></p><p><strong><span><span>八、注意事项</span></span></strong>  </p><p><span>1. <span>参加暑期学校的学生应严格遵守过程工程所相关安排，积极参加各项活动；</span></span></p><p><span>2. <span>申请者应保证申请时所提交的所有信息及纸质版材料的真实性、有效性、完整性，因不实信息或者伪造材料所造成的后果完全由本人承担。如发现有伪造排名证明材料、篡改成绩单、刻意提交不实信息等行为，过程工程所将直接取消申请人营员资格（如有）并向申请人所在学校汇报相应情况。</span> </span></p><p><span><span>后续夏令营相关重要通知将在本网站和过程所微信公众号上发布，请关注我所信息！</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：赵老师、闫老师（过程所研招办</span>/<span>教育处）</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span>010-82544960</span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>yzb@ipe.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span>为方便联系，请申报此次夏令营的同学加入“过程所研究生招生群<span>”<span>QQ</span><span>群，群号</span></span>：</span><span>920032334</span></p><p><span><span>地址：北京市海淀区中关村北二街</span>1<span>号，过程工程研究所</span></span></p><p><span>欢迎关注“中国科学院过程工程所研究生教育”公众号！</span><span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n\n<div>\n<p>附件下载：</p>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n\n</td>","textSha256":"98f2c24b994c5497dc5905c1a8a4be443a40cf4fb36a9af8cfe1311527536448","textLength":2113,"sourceSha256":"ec26e645334fa85d16d297200502fb6bbc9b1b24cd5c90ba3f15f427792a6e67","selector":"#zoom","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-57c1a90c97139c1d20f7","title":"2025年中国科学院过程工程研究所第二批大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:56.644662+00:00"}
